        <span style="font-size:0.72rem;font-weight:700;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:0.06em;color:rgba(201,168,76,0.85);">📋 Tax Organizer Uploads <span style="font-size:0.68rem;font-weight:400;color:var(--muted);text-transform:none;letter-spacing:0;">(${orgDocs.length} file${orgDocs.length!==1?'s':''} · view only)</span></span>
